cards.text:
Bene Gesserit Sister cost 3 persuasion, has Bene Gesserit faction tag.

You can send an agent to Bene Gesserit or Landsraad locations.&nbsp;

On reveal you gain 2 persuasion or 2 swords.

Liet Kynes cost 5 persuasion, has Emperor and Fremen faction tags.
On acquire: gain 1 Influence on Emperor faction.&nbsp;

You can send an agent to Fremen or City spaces.&nbsp;

On reveal you gain 2 persuasion for each Fremen card you have in play (including this one).

Scout cost 1 persuasion.

You can send an agent to City or Spice Trade spaces.&nbsp;

On reveal you gain 1 persuasion, 1 sword and you may retreat up to two of your troops.

Spice Hunter cost 2 persuasion, has Fremen faction tag.

You can send an agent to Fremen or Spice Trade spaces.&nbsp;

On reveal you gain 1 persuasion, 1 sword and if you have Fremen Bond gain 1 spice.

Web of Power cost 4 persuasion, has Bene Gesserit faction tag.

You may infiltrate Bene Gesserit locations.&nbsp;
If you have 2 Influence with Emperor: gain 2 solari.&nbsp;
If you have 2 Influence with Spacing Guild: draw 1 card from your deck.&nbsp;
If you have 2 Influence with Fremen: gain 1 water.

On reveal you gain 1 persuasion and gain 1 Influence with any Faction.

Reliable Informant cost 2 persuasion, has Spacing Guild faction tag.&nbsp;
You can send an agent to Spacing Guild locations using this card.&nbsp;
When you play this card you may place a Spy from your supply on an unoccupied observation post next to Spacing Guild, Bene Gesserit or Fremen location.&nbsp;
On reveal you gain 1 persuasion and 1 solari.

Truthtrance cost 4 persuasion, has Bene Gesserit faction tag.

You can send an agent to Emperor, Spacing Guild, Bene Gesserit, or Fremen locations.&nbsp;

On reveal you gain 1 persuasion.

Agent icon: Landsraad&nbsp;
Cost: 5 Solari&nbsp;

You may send an Agent here only once per game. Place your Councilor token on an unoccupied Council seat (to the right of the space). For the rest of the game, during each of your Reveal turns, gain 2 Persuasion.

Agent icon: Fremen&nbsp;
Combat space&nbsp;
Gain one Influence with the Fremen.&nbsp;

Gain 1 water.

Agent icon: Emperor&nbsp;

Gain one Influence with the Emperor.&nbsp;
Gain 2 Solari.

Agent icon: Landsraad&nbsp;
Choose one: Acquire Tech at a 1 spice Tech Discount; or send a Negotiator to the planet Ix.&nbsp;
Also: during your Reveal turn, gain 1 Persuasion if you have an Agent here.

Agent icon: Emperor&nbsp;

Gain one Influence with the Emperor.&nbsp;
If playing with the CHOAM Module, take a contract. If there are none remaining, or if you are playing without the CHOAM Module, gain 2 Solari instead.

Agent icon: Landsraad&nbsp;
Cost: 5 Solari&nbsp;

The first time you send an Agent here: Place your Councilor token on an unoccupied Council seat (to the right of the space).&nbsp;
For the rest of the game, during each of your Reveal turns, gain 2 Persuasion.&nbsp;

Each subsequent time you send an Agent here: Gain 2 spice, draw an Intrigue card, and recruit three troops.
